{
  "title": "Lovely Juicy Ukrainian Pork Kebabs",
  "description": "Tender and flavorful pork kebabs with a hint of spice, perfect for a family dinner. This dish is kid-friendly and can be served at a Buddhist temple gathering.",
  "cuisine": "Ukrainian",
